Hello,

I wrote some time ago a small simple script, meant to be run from cron to
automatically download kepler elements from the space-track.org, uncompress
them, convert them to UNIX file, and put them into an folder you specify.

A small tool for the selectio/filtering/renaming of the data sets is on my todo
list.

You can get it at http://www.lx2gt.lu/tleget.html

Feedback welcome!

